        {
          "_key": "o3an82xt",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The AI art platform you choose isn't just a tool — it's an environment. You'll spend hundreds of hours in its interface, develop muscle memory for its shortcuts, build libraries in its format, and shape your creative process around its capabilities. Switching platforms later is painful. Choosing right the first time pays compound interest on every project."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "s21my12n",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "y7c08mpy",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Model quality gets all the attention, but platform choice matters more for your actual daily experience. A slightly better model with a terrible interface will frustrate you daily. A slightly lesser model in a platform that fits your workflow will make you more productive. This guide compares platforms as creative environments, not just model wrappers."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
