        {
          "_key": "epzdhgi8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Adobe CC ($55/month) is the professional creative industry standard. Its AI features (Firefly, Generative Fill, Neural Filters) are integrated into tools professionals already know. It's the right choice for:"
