        },
        {
          "_key": "ou9ppgvo",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Adobe CC and Lovart Pro include review/approval features; Midjourney has none"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3z2bxkgn",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "aroxzsfe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Consistent output:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "97pngen9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Brand-locked generation prevents team members from drifting off-brand — Lovart's Brand Lock feature"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7nio80mu",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "hr3ilp46",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Usage analytics:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ns2wtdy2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Lovart Pro shows team usage patterns; most platforms don't"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bndma1s9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ujhaguzb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Access control:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "uihv98g2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Lovart and Adobe offer role-based permissions; Midjourney is single-user"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0ezbjcv0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1cqr36b4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For teams of 3+: Lovart or Adobe CC. Midjourney is designed for solo creators."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a5mh5fqr",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e17zcq6y",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How important is the template ecosystem?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ul59o0jt",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6mpzpi2x",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Critically important — and underrated in platform comparisons. A platform with strong templates means:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "24f3cmrz",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "w3z0aigo",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Starting from a professional layout instead of a blank canvas"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4kea9saa",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "681akp1d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Consistency across all your output (same colors, fonts, spacing)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "jzsomniz",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "blocl3wz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Speed: templates cut design time by 60-80%"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f0i3sqed",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ki9p9h57",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Brand integrity: team members use approved templates instead of inventing their own layouts"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "uov9mbaj",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "enx0aisp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Lovart includes 5,000+ templates across all content types. Canva has the largest template library overall. Midjourney has zero templates — every output starts from a prompt."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "adkpnq6o",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cu9to1fz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Can I migrate my work between platforms?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f583cq3n",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d6nl0cr3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Limited. AI art platforms use different file formats, project structures, and asset management systems. Migration capabilities:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6uhnzbj9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cqrenjly",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Images:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "xtv299bc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Easy to export/import between any platform (PNG/JPG are universal)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7hx09kdr",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "s4r0dh2k",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Editable projects:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9njnjjen",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Generally not portable (Lovart files don't open in Canva, Midjourney prompts and history don't export)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "lwf0d5au",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "nr6xyan1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Brand kits:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ly6dpp8a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Manual recreation required when switching platforms"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "m3xaw2iv",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3ydafdkz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Template libraries:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "t2zc1pnm",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Locked to platform; can't export"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "arhuun7c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5xh17n01",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Choose your platform with the understanding that switching will cost you your project history and require rebuilding asset libraries."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "dzpxhm09",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "oh4humr1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What platform is best for content creators vs. professional designers?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nmh5xkn2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "wxpwrh1g",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Content creators (social media managers, marketers, entrepreneurs):"
        },
        {
          "_key": "guba3tf6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Lovart or Canva. Designed for speed, not pixel-perfect control. AI handles layout; you handle content and approval."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "upaw0fos",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "zimuaj7m",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Professional designers (graphic designers, art directors, agency creatives):"
        },
        {
          "_key": "kq5pgd5l",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Adobe CC + Midjourney. Maximum creative control, industry-standard output formats, no compromises on quality or precision."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "g8srkqbk",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1rz57p2w",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Hybrid (designers who need speed + quality):"
        },
        {
          "_key": "fg5ptw8a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Lovart Pro + Adobe CC. Generate and template in Lovart; final polish and advanced compositing in Adobe. This is increasingly common."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "63gvwbec",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "tyj2h4bs",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How do I evaluate a platform before committing?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "s8uvn3rm",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "mdg06tla",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "30-day evaluation framework:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ulizdqj4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9artc83x",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Create the same 5 projects in 2-3 candidate platforms (poster, social post, logo concept, photo edit, multi-page document)."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "u4cezau9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "glnicqdx",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Time each project. Note friction points."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k6fjiskn",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fgsvipx1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Export each project in all formats you'll need. Test quality."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "01axwzqy",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "m3mtmaqn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If evaluating for a team: have teammates try the same projects. Compare experiences."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "uyy8x2wg",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "s5q10984",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Calculate total cost including subscription, asset costs, and integration with your existing tool stack."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nzsbwaqv",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "xaeyoowi",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Most platforms offer free trials. Use them for real work, not just feature exploration."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "zw7vacrd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "w9ing8d4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Will platform choice still matter in 2 years?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "dhtluo08",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "60oxt8cs",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, but differently. As AI models converge toward similar quality ceilings, platform differentiation will shift from \"which has the best AI?\" to \"which understands my workflow best?\" The platform that learns your preferences, automates your repetitive tasks, and integrates with your tools will be more valuable than the platform with marginally better image quality."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "s3y9uxvt",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6ko8529z",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Lovart's direction — AI design agent that learns your creative patterns — represents this shift. Choose platforms that invest in understanding you, not just in better models."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2u9wodrz",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "mew4mg3p",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What Most Guides Won't Tell You"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "img-7bb84bd7",
      "_type": "imageSource",
      "alt": "Lovart AI design agent interface showing real-time generation",
      "sourceType": "external",
      "url": "https://assets-persist.lovart.ai/img/0ec3ec8352e24750bddb7764c24e81e1/805d2e070d4404ed0cd6ae865930375919374b97.png"
    },
    {
      "_key": "93lc0612",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kjwr431r",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "The best platform is the one your team will actually use."
        },
        {
          "_key": "kzg47rk3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A technically superior platform that team members resist is worse than a good-enough platform everyone embraces. Adoption matters more than features."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "23f6pwsl",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "oigpajo4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Platform lock-in is real and expensive."
        },
        {
          "_key": "ou8ekto7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Your asset library, template collection, and generation history accumulate. The longer you stay, the harder it is to leave. Choose carefully. Switch only when the benefit clearly exceeds the migration cost."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
